Measurement of the last 30 tasks, average:

waiting for analytics — 4 days;
writing requirements — 1 day;
waiting for design — 5 days;
development — 3 days;
waiting for code review — 2 days;
waiting for testing — 4 days;
waiting for release window — 3 days.

Total: active work 4 days, waiting 18 days.

Six months ago, with four people, the cycle time was 9 days.

19 tasks are in progress simultaneously with 11 people.

There is only one designer, who splits their time with another company product.

Releases are on Thursdays: this was decided a year ago when releases were done manually. Now, releases are automated and take 20 minutes.
